        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Press the blanched almond halves into the surface in neat concentric rings before the cake goes in the oven. They will toast gently to a golden colour as the cake bakes. Line the tin with a double layer of baking paper, and tie a double layer of newspaper around the outside -- this prevents the edges from over-baking during the long cook."
          }
